title: MrsWilliams
---
Hello there, dearie.
Nice weather today, isn't it?
Could you please see if there are any new packages for me today?
I'm expecting a package from my grandson.
He recently went on a trip and I want to know more about it.
He went on a trip to Africa and spent two weeks there.
I have been expecting him to send me something sooner than later.
